{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42218","headline":"还过东都留守周公筵上赠座客 · 徐铉","name":"还过东都留守周公筵上赠座客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贾生三载在长沙，故友相思道路赊。\n已分终年甘寂寞，岂知今日还京华。\n麟符上相恩偏厚，隋苑留欢日欲斜。\n明旦江头倍惆怅，远山芳草映残霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42218.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42218","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}